1
00:00:03,857 --> 00:00:06,487
So... how is he doing?

2
00:00:06,987 --> 00:00:10,657
Citizen registration number 021723,

3
00:00:10,657 --> 00:00:14,367
former chairman of the Citizen Health Bureau, Daedalus Yumeno.

4
00:00:15,997 --> 00:00:19,667
He was stripped of authority by
 order of the Administration Bureau.

5
00:00:19,667 --> 00:00:20,797
Following his dismissal,

6
00:00:20,797 --> 00:00:22,797
he has not done anything out of the ordinary.

7
00:00:22,797 --> 00:00:24,507
Things are quiet.

8
00:00:25,007 --> 00:00:28,047
Do you understand the reason for that, Kristeva?

9
00:00:28,597 --> 00:00:31,137
You're in a good mood today.

10
00:00:31,767 --> 00:00:33,017
Is that so?

11
00:00:33,637 --> 00:00:36,977
It's just that I've accepted myself for who I am,

12
00:00:36,977 --> 00:00:40,727
and I'm rising to heights where I've no need for others.

13
00:00:43,147 --> 00:00:45,607
The monster no longer interests me...

14
00:00:47,617 --> 00:00:49,737
But <i>he's</i> different.

15
00:00:50,327 --> 00:00:54,747
His beloved Re-l Mayer,
 granddaughter of the Administrator, has died...

16
00:00:54,747 --> 00:00:57,167
along with that PROXY called Monad,

17
00:00:57,167 --> 00:01:00,037
whose existence he had been concealing.

18
00:01:00,837 --> 00:01:03,337
He has lost his raison d'être.

19
00:01:03,967 --> 00:01:06,337
"The reason for existence", sir?

20
00:01:06,337 --> 00:01:09,927
Look at the minimalist beauty of this world.

21
00:01:10,967 --> 00:01:15,177
All of us are manufactured cogwheels in this utopia.

22
00:01:15,687 --> 00:01:20,477
Our existence is allowed so we can
 fulfill this "reason" we've been given.

23
00:01:20,477 --> 00:01:26,527
But Daedalus Yumeno has lost both PROXY and Re-l Mayer,

24
00:01:26,527 --> 00:01:30,197
his raisons d'être, at the same time.

25
00:01:40,377 --> 00:01:43,047
In other words, he is a chipped cog.

26
00:02:02,727 --> 00:02:03,937
<i>Re-l...</i>

