2137
00:03:55,007 --> 00:04:02,227
A being that was sealed away, said
 to be invincible and immortal, has died.

2138
00:04:03,387 --> 00:04:05,607
Do you know the reason why?

2139
00:04:06,557 --> 00:04:09,147
Its awakening will call forth destruction.

2140
00:04:09,147 --> 00:04:12,527
Blood will continue to be shed in our tranquil utopia.

2141
00:04:12,817 --> 00:04:14,777
Do you know the reason why?

2142
00:04:15,527 --> 00:04:18,617
The report has already been submitted.

2143
00:04:18,617 --> 00:04:21,537
There are many issues that we must address.

2144
00:04:22,327 --> 00:04:24,917
The weakening of both the magnetic field of the dome's outer shell

2145
00:04:24,917 --> 00:04:28,287
and the life support unit's energy source pose risks

2146
00:04:28,287 --> 00:04:32,917
that necessitate a drastic reform of
 the entire system - now an imperative task.

2147
00:04:32,917 --> 00:04:36,547
That is one of the conclusions you have come up with.

2148
00:04:36,547 --> 00:04:41,307
Too much thinking will burden your mind and cause sin.

2149
00:04:41,597 --> 00:04:47,607
Meaning what happened to Re-l Mayer could have happened to you.

2150
00:04:49,357 --> 00:04:52,607
You know the reason why, do you not, Raul?

2151
00:04:57,867 --> 00:04:59,327
You are dismissed.

2152
00:04:59,617 --> 00:05:04,867
We must think about what we
 must do now that we have lost PROXY.

2153
00:05:04,867 --> 00:05:07,577
We know too little.

2154
00:05:07,577 --> 00:05:10,627
And therefore must think.

2155
00:05:10,627 --> 00:05:14,007
And therefore must think.

2156
00:05:14,007 --> 00:05:15,507
Indeed.

2157
00:05:15,507 --> 00:05:16,757
Indeed.

2158
00:05:16,757 --> 00:05:18,387
Indeed...

2159
00:05:24,677 --> 00:05:26,597
Tell me the truth...

2160
00:05:30,897 --> 00:05:34,437
"I think, therefore I am"...

2161
00:05:45,447 --> 00:05:46,747
Chief,

2162
00:05:46,747 --> 00:05:47,867
you are hurt.

2163
00:05:48,417 --> 00:05:50,667
Visible wounds are nothing.

2164
00:05:50,667 --> 00:05:51,667
Just in case,

2165
00:05:51,667 --> 00:05:54,297
I will call for a medical check from the Health Bureau.

2166
00:05:54,297 --> 00:05:56,757
The Administrator won't give any answers.

2167
00:05:56,757 --> 00:05:58,587
He just poses questions.

2168
00:05:59,087 --> 00:06:00,217
Why is that?

2169
00:06:00,757 --> 00:06:02,257
I cannot understand why.

2170
00:06:02,257 --> 00:06:04,267
I can.

2171
00:06:04,717 --> 00:06:08,517
The grief-stricken cry of one who
 has lost his most beloved in an instant...

2172
00:06:08,847 --> 00:06:11,647
Administrator, why do you avert your eyes?!

2173
00:06:12,057 --> 00:06:13,147
Why...

2174
00:06:13,727 --> 00:06:14,897
Why?!

2175
00:06:16,897 --> 00:06:19,357
The reality which is called Romdeau...

2176
00:06:21,067 --> 00:06:22,277
What is going on?!

2177
00:06:22,947 --> 00:06:25,287
Emergency stop code detected.

2178
00:06:25,577 --> 00:06:28,367
Emergency phase sequence initiated.

2179
00:06:29,167 --> 00:06:30,247
Confirmed.

2180
00:06:35,337 --> 00:06:39,257
meditation    existence

2181
00:06:37,717 --> 00:06:40,257
After a disconnection lasting two and a half minutes,

2182
00:06:40,257 --> 00:06:41,837
it automatically recovered.

2183
00:06:41,837 --> 00:06:44,387
We have not determined its cause,

2184
00:06:45,177 --> 00:06:49,267
but there has been no damage to the life
 support or other systems due to this blackout.

2185
00:06:49,267 --> 00:06:50,597
"<i>This</i> blackout"?

2186
00:06:50,597 --> 00:06:52,357
Three weeks ago,

2187
00:06:52,357 --> 00:06:56,107
there were other blackouts with identical circumstances.

2188
00:06:56,687 --> 00:06:59,067
Were we informed of these?

2189
00:06:59,067 --> 00:07:00,067
No.

2190
00:07:00,607 --> 00:07:03,697
Each blackout was intermittent,
 on the order of several milliseconds.

2191
00:07:03,697 --> 00:07:05,947
They were deemed accidents.

2192
00:07:06,237 --> 00:07:12,417
Analysis of the results indicating
 intentional sabotage have been inconclusive.

2193
00:07:12,917 --> 00:07:14,457
A terrorist act by infected autoreivs...

2194
00:07:14,837 --> 00:07:17,207
no, by immigrants?

2195
00:07:17,547 --> 00:07:18,837
Still...

2196
00:07:22,467 --> 00:07:24,887
Two minutes and 17 seconds...

2197
00:07:27,387 --> 00:07:28,717
Kristeva.

2198
00:07:28,717 --> 00:07:29,847
Yes, sir.

2199
00:07:29,847 --> 00:07:31,097
What do you think?

2200
00:07:31,387 --> 00:07:33,897
Regarding the incidents that led to the most recent blackout,

2201
00:07:33,897 --> 00:07:35,517
from their times and results,

2202
00:07:35,517 --> 00:07:41,817
it can be conjectured that they were
 experiments intended to fool the Security Bureau.

2203
00:07:41,817 --> 00:07:43,407
Beautiful.

2204
00:07:43,407 --> 00:07:44,907
What about <i>this</i> blackout?

2205
00:07:44,907 --> 00:07:48,077
I believe it is reasonable to construe it as a warning.

2206
00:07:48,657 --> 00:07:49,787
I see...

2207
00:07:50,327 --> 00:07:51,497
And the real reason for that is?

2208
00:07:51,497 --> 00:07:55,207
If we wish to keep the city's life support system operational,

2209
00:07:55,207 --> 00:07:58,167
a blackout must not exceed three minutes.

2210
00:07:58,167 --> 00:08:02,507
So the perpetrator does not wish to cause <i>human</i> deaths?

2211
00:08:03,177 --> 00:08:04,217
Indeed.

2212
00:08:09,807 --> 00:08:10,977
Actually...

2213
00:08:11,637 --> 00:08:13,767
please make an appointment for a medical check after all.

2214
00:08:16,107 --> 00:08:18,067
Let's ask him to do the examination.

2215
00:08:18,067 --> 00:08:20,567
However, his authority has been...

2216
00:08:21,147 --> 00:08:23,527
I'd like to ask you to do something for me as well.

2217
00:08:24,027 --> 00:08:27,277
Please find the research data he has hidden.

2218
00:08:28,527 --> 00:08:32,537
I don't intend to examine anyone anymore.

2219
00:08:32,537 --> 00:08:36,997
You may look like a boy, but you are a pretty brash man.

2220
00:08:37,627 --> 00:08:39,917
Could you please leave?

2221
00:08:39,917 --> 00:08:43,257
No, perhaps you are a romantic.

2222
00:08:43,257 --> 00:08:46,047
Deleuze will arrange for a different doctor.

2223
00:08:46,047 --> 00:08:47,007
Well...

2224
00:08:47,677 --> 00:08:49,677
what are you trying to say?

2225
00:08:49,677 --> 00:08:51,267
What are you talking about?

2226
00:08:51,717 --> 00:08:54,517
You called me all the way out here, yet...

2227
00:08:55,267 --> 00:08:57,857
I'm sorry Chief.

2228
00:08:57,857 --> 00:08:59,397
I no longer have...

2229
00:09:00,017 --> 00:09:02,277
anything to say.

2230
00:09:02,987 --> 00:09:05,197
The reason why I was manufactured

2231
00:09:05,197 --> 00:09:07,277
was to protect both her and the subject

2232
00:09:07,277 --> 00:09:09,447
and to raise her into a healthy girl.

2233
00:09:10,657 --> 00:09:13,577
But now that I've lost both of them,

2234
00:09:14,077 --> 00:09:15,117
I...

2235
00:09:15,657 --> 00:09:18,037
have lost my raison d'être.

2236
00:09:18,707 --> 00:09:21,917
As someone who heard your heart's cry of anguish,

2237
00:09:22,377 --> 00:09:25,127
I decided to come to do what I can.

2238
00:09:25,587 --> 00:09:27,337
You fancy yourself a telepath?

2239
00:09:31,257 --> 00:09:32,847
It's your fault.

2240
00:09:32,847 --> 00:09:36,477
For some reason, it only seems to
 have an effect on Daedalus Yumeno...

2241
00:09:36,937 --> 00:09:38,557
strangely enough.

2242
00:09:40,017 --> 00:09:42,437
He says he agrees to examine me.

2243
00:09:42,937 --> 00:09:47,907
In the meantime, search for the data I asked you about earlier.

2244
00:09:48,357 --> 00:09:49,567
Where are you going, sir?

2245
00:09:50,157 --> 00:09:52,737
He needs a change of pace.

2246
00:09:53,197 --> 00:09:54,787
There's no need to worry.

2247
00:09:54,787 --> 00:09:57,707
However, he has not received permission to go outside yet.

2248
00:09:58,367 --> 00:10:01,337
Giving permission is my job, is it not?

2249
00:10:01,787 --> 00:10:03,247
Understood.

2250
00:10:09,887 --> 00:10:11,637
You are a cruel man.

2251
00:10:12,177 --> 00:10:14,007
There is no such "data" here.

2252
00:10:14,717 --> 00:10:17,177
I'll keep looking until I find it.

2253
00:10:17,637 --> 00:10:19,017
I'm competent.

2254
00:10:19,847 --> 00:10:22,647
So, you have lots of free time then.

2255
00:10:25,147 --> 00:10:26,237
They're fine.

2256
00:10:27,027 --> 00:10:29,527
They don't "socialize" with the Representative.

2257
00:10:29,817 --> 00:10:30,947
"The Representative"?

2258
00:10:30,947 --> 00:10:33,027
Oh, the Administrator.

2259
00:10:33,027 --> 00:10:34,487
Well, well...

2260
00:10:34,487 --> 00:10:36,367
you're quite thorough.

2261
00:10:36,367 --> 00:10:41,207
That is why you forced a laid off physician to do an examination.

2262
00:10:41,667 --> 00:10:42,667
Am I right?

2263
00:10:44,667 --> 00:10:46,457
Impressive.

2264
00:10:46,457 --> 00:10:48,417
You were faster than I thought.

2265
00:10:48,417 --> 00:10:50,177
You played around too much.

2266
00:10:50,717 --> 00:10:52,927
You're rather timid.

2267
00:10:53,427 --> 00:10:56,807
I know the limit for the life support system well enough.

2268
00:10:57,267 --> 00:11:01,347
It seems the Administrator has interpreted it as a warning.

2269
00:11:01,897 --> 00:11:04,357
That's a nice, misleading interpretation.

2270
00:11:04,817 --> 00:11:09,397
The Security Bureau will handle the rest by
 arresting a convenient suspect at a convenient time.

2271
00:11:10,027 --> 00:11:15,577
Daedalus Yumeno, citizen registration number 021723.

2272
00:11:15,577 --> 00:11:18,157
Two minutes, 17 seconds and 23 milliseconds.

2273
00:11:18,747 --> 00:11:20,787
I did many tests, after all.

2274
00:11:21,367 --> 00:11:23,327
Was that a threat?

2275
00:11:23,327 --> 00:11:25,127
A very effective one.

2276
00:11:25,627 --> 00:11:30,757
Perhaps you thought I'd let out that you
 got rid of someone who was in your way.

2277
00:11:32,007 --> 00:11:33,337
What are you talking about?

2278
00:11:33,637 --> 00:11:35,967
Using cogito was a bad idea.

2279
00:11:37,847 --> 00:11:39,727
Let's drop the pretense.

2280
00:11:39,727 --> 00:11:42,387
The only reason I took such a roundabout approach

2281
00:11:42,387 --> 00:11:45,107
was so we could talk without the Administrator eavesdropping.

2282
00:11:45,727 --> 00:11:47,777
Are you going to get rid of me in the same way?

2283
00:11:48,357 --> 00:11:52,857
Is it not enough that you took away my beloved and demoted me?

2284
00:11:53,487 --> 00:11:56,867
You brought it on yourself.

2285
00:11:58,237 --> 00:11:59,997
You used Monad as bait,

2286
00:11:59,997 --> 00:12:01,957
blinded the Administrator,

2287
00:12:01,957 --> 00:12:04,997
and concealed <i>its</i> existence.

2288
00:12:08,127 --> 00:12:09,627
I see.

2289
00:12:10,507 --> 00:12:12,967
You had something you had to hide from the Administrator

2290
00:12:12,967 --> 00:12:17,597
even after getting cornered with no way out.

2291
00:12:18,677 --> 00:12:21,017
It was another PROXY.

2292
00:12:21,387 --> 00:12:24,097
That incident was convenient;

2293
00:12:24,097 --> 00:12:29,647
you had hit a wall and needed to hide the
 other PROXY's existence from the collective.

2294
00:12:30,897 --> 00:12:32,147
That's true.

2295
00:12:32,697 --> 00:12:37,277
And it erased the existence of yet another.

2296
00:12:37,827 --> 00:12:39,447
In other words...

2297
00:12:41,247 --> 00:12:43,617
Re-l Mayer is alive.

2298
00:13:26,497 --> 00:13:28,457
Are you all right, Re-l?

2299
00:13:28,457 --> 00:13:29,537
Yeah...

2300
00:13:29,537 --> 00:13:31,207
Did you find anyone?

2301
00:13:31,667 --> 00:13:32,627
Well,

2302
00:13:32,627 --> 00:13:35,917
I thought investigating the power plant was our first priority, so...

2303
00:13:36,377 --> 00:13:40,047
Now that we've gone outside, supplies are our top priority, right?

2304
00:13:40,547 --> 00:13:41,597
Iggy...

2305
00:13:42,057 --> 00:13:44,347
Don't worry, Re-l.

2306
00:13:44,677 --> 00:13:48,097
The city's retro, but its science is pretty good.

2307
00:13:48,097 --> 00:13:50,107
Its energy source matched the ship's.

2308
00:13:50,647 --> 00:13:52,647
As long as I connect them just
 right, I should be able to interface-

2309
00:13:52,647 --> 00:13:53,607
Iggy.

2310
00:13:55,357 --> 00:13:58,857
There is no one in this city.

2311
00:14:05,617 --> 00:14:08,207
The outside world, hm?

2312
00:14:09,667 --> 00:14:12,707
You were able to deceive the Administrator.

2313
00:14:14,087 --> 00:14:18,087
But the eventual fate of those who leave utopia is clear...

2314
00:14:18,467 --> 00:14:22,967
What prompted a realist like her to risk her life

2315
00:14:22,967 --> 00:14:24,717
was her raison d'être...

2316
00:14:24,717 --> 00:14:27,307
It was PROXY itself.

2317
00:14:29,017 --> 00:14:33,977
You must have been thinking of
using her to obtain the other PROXY.

2318
00:14:34,647 --> 00:14:38,107
But you began to think that it would be impossible...

2319
00:14:38,107 --> 00:14:40,907
and that you would also lose her.

2320
00:14:42,067 --> 00:14:45,737
You cannot protect her if she's outside.

2321
00:14:46,247 --> 00:14:48,867
That is why you sent me the message.

2322
00:14:49,327 --> 00:14:51,827
You're saying I will cooperate with you?

2323
00:14:52,417 --> 00:14:54,837
You, who tried to murder Re-l?

2324
00:14:57,627 --> 00:14:59,757
<i>I</i> tried to murder her?

2325
00:15:03,297 --> 00:15:04,467
It can't be...

2326
00:15:07,017 --> 00:15:10,267
<i>Maybe it'd be better if people didn't exist.</i>

2327
00:15:11,977 --> 00:15:13,727
<i>They will continue to work</i>

2328
00:15:14,477 --> 00:15:16,527
<i>until the world rots away.</i>

2329
00:15:18,067 --> 00:15:19,027
<i>For whom, though?</i>

2330
00:15:20,107 --> 00:15:23,657
<i>They've lost what was supposed to be their raison d'être - people.</i>

2331
00:15:25,407 --> 00:15:27,407
<i>They had no reason in the first place...</i>

2332
00:15:28,117 --> 00:15:29,117
Re-l...

2333
00:15:29,707 --> 00:15:30,657
Well,

2334
00:15:31,417 --> 00:15:35,167
I was wondering what you'd do if I were to go away.

2335
00:15:35,497 --> 00:15:37,747
Don't jinx yourself.

2336
00:15:37,747 --> 00:15:38,837
What about you, Re-l?

2337
00:15:39,417 --> 00:15:40,917
What if I were to go away?

2338
00:15:42,967 --> 00:15:44,257
Silly.

2339
00:15:44,257 --> 00:15:46,847
I'd never leave you, Re-l.

2340
00:15:47,427 --> 00:15:49,387
It's not a laughing matter.

2341
00:15:49,387 --> 00:15:51,057
You're "laughing" though.

2342
00:15:51,727 --> 00:15:53,937
Hey, Re-l...

2343
00:15:54,897 --> 00:15:56,357
Don't worry.

2344
00:15:56,817 --> 00:15:58,687
I was just letting my weakness show for a bit.

2345
00:15:58,687 --> 00:16:01,067
Even <i>you</i> are a bit tired, huh.

2346
00:16:01,607 --> 00:16:04,567
I'll refuel the machine, so rest, okay?

2347
00:16:05,947 --> 00:16:07,327
<i>As for myself...</i>

2348
00:16:08,077 --> 00:16:09,447
<i>For what have I been...</i>

2349
00:16:10,867 --> 00:16:13,367
<i>It's supposed to have been a journey to gain answers!</i>

2350
00:16:13,957 --> 00:16:14,997
<i>But...</i>

2351
00:16:15,537 --> 00:16:17,957
<i>even if I find PROXY...</i>

2352
00:16:18,837 --> 00:16:20,507
<i>I will...</i>

2353
00:16:23,797 --> 00:16:25,467
Why would the Representative do that?

2354
00:16:25,467 --> 00:16:27,677
You're still young, after all.

2355
00:16:28,387 --> 00:16:30,967
It seems you've underestimated the Administrator.

2356
00:16:30,967 --> 00:16:35,437
Even if she is his grandchild, betrayal will lead to condemnation.

2357
00:16:35,437 --> 00:16:38,437
As a citizen, it's a rule that he should obviously follow.

2358
00:16:40,187 --> 00:16:42,897
And you thought you had him wrapped around your finger?

2359
00:16:43,527 --> 00:16:45,947
Let me ask you again what the
 significance behind the blackout was.

2360
00:16:46,277 --> 00:16:47,317
That was a messa-

2361
00:16:47,317 --> 00:16:50,827
I am not such an optimist that I'll take things at face value.

2362
00:16:51,367 --> 00:16:54,077
I can easily tell that it's a poisoned dish.

2363
00:16:55,367 --> 00:17:00,837
By causing this blackout, you
 obtained an enormous amount of energy.

2364
00:17:00,837 --> 00:17:02,417
What did you do with it?

2365
00:17:03,257 --> 00:17:05,837
I tried to revive PROXY.

2366
00:17:06,127 --> 00:17:07,467
Beautiful...

2367
00:17:08,297 --> 00:17:11,057
Submit to my terms.

2368
00:17:11,057 --> 00:17:13,227
I can give you a toy.

2369
00:17:13,727 --> 00:17:17,477
Of course, you don't have any other choice right now.

2370
00:17:19,477 --> 00:17:20,517
A "toy", huh.

2371
00:17:35,117 --> 00:17:36,917
Where'd you come from?!

2372
00:17:42,667 --> 00:17:44,547
Pretty pendant...

2373
00:17:44,877 --> 00:17:45,917
This is...

2374
00:17:45,917 --> 00:17:47,337
Something you treasure?

2375
00:17:47,797 --> 00:17:49,137
Not exactly...

2376
00:17:49,137 --> 00:17:50,637
Then gimme.

2377
00:17:51,927 --> 00:17:52,967
Hey!

2378
00:17:52,967 --> 00:17:53,807
Wait!

2379
00:17:59,727 --> 00:18:02,317
Why did PROXY die?

2380
00:18:02,647 --> 00:18:06,487
Because its amrita cells, which are
 supposed to be immortal, were destroyed.

2381
00:18:06,487 --> 00:18:07,817
What caused that?

2382
00:18:07,817 --> 00:18:11,947
My "toy" was taken from me before I could investigate.

2383
00:18:11,947 --> 00:18:13,907
What I did to you was cruel.

2384
00:18:14,747 --> 00:18:17,867
As an apology, I'll lend you my toy.

2385
00:18:17,867 --> 00:18:19,577
You may play around with it however you wish.

2386
00:18:19,577 --> 00:18:20,497
However,

2387
00:18:20,497 --> 00:18:23,497
you must either be watched or directed

2388
00:18:23,497 --> 00:18:26,007
by an adult that knows right from wrong.

2389
00:18:26,837 --> 00:18:28,837
An adult's toy, huh.

2390
00:18:29,837 --> 00:18:31,137
Good boy.

2391
00:18:44,517 --> 00:18:46,437
<i>Let's play forever!</i>

2392
00:18:46,437 --> 00:18:47,777
<i>That's not possible.</i>

2393
00:18:49,447 --> 00:18:50,737
<i>Why?</i>

2394
00:18:50,737 --> 00:18:52,947
<i>This is a very nice place.</i>

2395
00:18:53,277 --> 00:18:54,617
<i>That's true...</i>

2396
00:18:55,327 --> 00:18:56,447
<i>But...</i>

2397
00:18:57,947 --> 00:19:00,037
<i>I have someone I need to see.</i>

2398
00:19:00,617 --> 00:19:01,707
<i>Are you afraid?</i>

2399
00:19:02,037 --> 00:19:04,337
<i>Do you really not want to see him?</i>

2400
00:19:05,047 --> 00:19:06,667
<i>Even if you manage to see him,</i>

2401
00:19:07,877 --> 00:19:11,837
<i>you might be frozen in fear.</i>

2402
00:19:13,007 --> 00:19:16,387
<i>Maybe he can't change back anymore.</i>

2403
00:19:17,517 --> 00:19:19,477
<i>What you're looking for...</i>

2404
00:19:19,977 --> 00:19:22,307
<i>might be something cruel.</i>

2405
00:19:22,847 --> 00:19:24,607
<i>Do you still want it?</i>

2406
00:19:25,477 --> 00:19:26,727
The truth...

2407
00:19:30,027 --> 00:19:31,697
He has it, so...

2408
00:19:45,457 --> 00:19:46,997
A charm...

2409
00:20:03,347 --> 00:20:05,607
I'll say this without fear of being misunderstood.

2410
00:20:05,607 --> 00:20:08,147
I want to save this world.

2411
00:20:08,647 --> 00:20:11,527
I'm so impressed that I'm close to tears.

2412
00:20:13,487 --> 00:20:15,367
It seems you lack training.

2413
00:20:16,367 --> 00:20:19,487
Unfortunately, I am not as soft as the Administrator.

2414
00:20:20,287 --> 00:20:21,907
If necessary,

2415
00:20:21,907 --> 00:20:24,917
I'll act as rudely as I like,

2416
00:20:24,917 --> 00:20:26,877
Daedalus Yumeno...

2417
00:20:32,917 --> 00:20:33,837
Now...

2418
00:20:33,837 --> 00:20:36,597
go ahead and work hard on your beloved research.

2419
00:20:36,597 --> 00:20:39,177
From now on, it's only for me.

2420
00:20:44,597 --> 00:20:45,977
Have you found it?

2421
00:20:46,517 --> 00:20:48,397
Not yet.

2422
00:20:48,397 --> 00:20:50,857
If you weren't able to find it,

2423
00:20:50,857 --> 00:20:52,687
it means it's not here.

2424
00:20:53,237 --> 00:20:55,567
What about Daedalus Yumeno's status?

2425
00:20:56,027 --> 00:20:57,817
I have reversed the dismissal.

2426
00:20:58,577 --> 00:21:02,327
From now on, he will carry out his
 responsibilities under my direction.

2427
00:21:02,747 --> 00:21:05,617
It took a bit of work to tame him,

2428
00:21:06,077 --> 00:21:09,457
but he will learn much from this experience.

2429
00:21:09,707 --> 00:21:13,257
Only the victor has the right to become the righteous.

2430
00:21:15,217 --> 00:21:16,467
Welcome back.

2431
00:21:16,467 --> 00:21:18,887
I'm glad you've come back...

2432
00:21:23,347 --> 00:21:25,137
"For me"?

2433
00:21:25,637 --> 00:21:27,807
He doesn't even know the true significance.

2434
00:21:28,397 --> 00:21:30,397
It's all for you,

2435
00:21:30,397 --> 00:21:31,527
Re-l...

2436
00:21:32,897 --> 00:21:34,277
My Re-l...

2437
00:21:35,397 --> 00:21:36,607
Re-l...

2438
00:21:38,817 --> 00:21:40,077
Re-l...

2439
00:21:40,077 --> 00:21:41,277
Re-l!

2440
00:21:43,537 --> 00:21:44,537
Re-l.

2441
00:21:44,997 --> 00:21:46,117
Re-l!

2442
00:21:48,327 --> 00:21:49,377
Iggy...

2443
00:21:49,377 --> 00:21:50,337
Hey.

2444
00:21:50,337 --> 00:21:52,337
Pulling a disappearing act on me right off the bat?

2445
00:21:52,337 --> 00:21:54,507
I looked all over the place for you.

2446
00:21:57,467 --> 00:21:58,587
What?

2447
00:21:58,587 --> 00:21:59,887
What's the matter?

2448
00:22:00,387 --> 00:22:01,387
Hey...

2449
00:22:01,387 --> 00:22:02,927
Are you really all right?

2450
00:22:04,717 --> 00:22:06,057
It's nothing.

2451
00:22:06,687 --> 00:22:08,057
I had a dream.

2452
00:22:26,247 --> 00:22:29,417
There's no longer any need to sneak around.

2453
00:22:30,827 --> 00:22:34,627
So this is the product of two minutes and 17 seconds...

2454
00:22:47,977 --> 00:22:50,267
This should be more than enough.

2455
00:23:01,947 --> 00:23:03,367
Now...

2456
00:23:03,367 --> 00:23:05,157
all I have to do is load them.

2457
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,367
Please

2458
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,367
could

2459
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,367
you

2460
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,367
stop

2461
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,367
the

2462
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,367
noise,

2463
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,367
I'm

2464
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,367
trying

2465
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,367
to

2466
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,367
get

2467
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,367
some

2468
00:24:18,307 --> 00:24:29,367
rest

2469
00:24:18,707 --> 00:24:21,547
Please

2470
00:24:18,707 --> 00:24:21,547
Please

2471
